{"result":"ok","response":"collection","data":[{"id":"74ad3ad0-41e2-4919-a3dd-e5061c3444da","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Futago Matomete \"Kanojo\" ni Shinai?"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u53cc\u5b50\u307e\u3068\u3081\u3066\u300e\u30ab\u30ce\u30b8\u30e7\u300f\u306b\u3057\u306a\u3044\uff1f"},{"en":"Why Don't You Make the Twins Your \"Girlfriend\" Together?"},{"en":"Why Not Make Both Twins \"Girlfriends\"?"},{"es-la":"\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 no juntar a las gemelas y convertirlas en una novia?"},{"vi":"Sao l\u1ea1i kh\u00f4ng bi\u1ebfn c\u1eb7p ch\u1ecb em song sinh th\u00e0nh \"b\u1ea1n g\u00e1i\" lu\u00f4n nh\u1ec9?"}],"description":{"en":"Usami is a beautiful classmate with good morals and top grades. At school, she views Sakuto as her rival. But when he bumps into her after school, he sees a different side of her. She was playing at an arcade after classes, and she had this innocent smile that one couldn't imagine on her at school. For the sake of getting along with her, he gets close to her at school and then plays together with her after school. They each have their places where they can deepen their bonds, and at last...","ja":"\u54c1\u884c\u65b9\u6b63\u3001\u6210\u7e3e\u30c8\u30c3\u30d7\u306e\u540c\u7d1a\u751f\u7f8e\u5c11\u5973\u30fb\u5b87\u4f50\u898b\u3002\u6821\u5185\u3067\u4ffa\u3092\u30e9\u30a4\u30d0\u30eb\u8996\u3057\u3066\u7a81\u3063\u304b\u304b\u308b\u5f7c\u5973\u306b\u306f\u653e\u8ab2\u5f8c\u3001\u5225\u306e\u9854\u304c\u3042\u308b\u3002\u5f7c\u5973\u306f\u653e\u8ab2\u5f8c\u3001\u30b2\u30fc\u30bb\u30f3\u3067\u904a\u3073\u3001\u5b66\u6821\u3067\u306f\u60f3\u50cf\u3067\u304d\u306a\u3044\u7121\u90aa\u6c17\u306a\u7b11\u9854\u3092\u898b\u305b\u308b\u306e\u3060\u3002\u4ffa\u306f\u5b87\u4f50\u898b\u3068\u4ef2\u826f\u304f\u306a\u308b\u305f\u3081\u3001\u6821\u5185\u3067\u306f\u5bc4\u308a\u6dfb\u3044\u3001\u653e\u8ab2\u5f8c\u306f\u4e00\u7dd2\u306b\u904a\u3076\u3002\u305d\u308c\u305e\u308c\u306e\u5834\u6240\u3067\u4ef2\u3092\u6df1\u3081\u3001\u3064\u3044\u306b\u2026\u2026\u5b66\u6821\u5e30\u308a\u306e\u5b87\u4f50\u898b\u304b\u3089\u544a\u767d\u304c\uff01\uff1f\n___\n**Links:** \n- [Official LN (JP)](https:\/\/fantasiabunko.jp\/special\/202311futago)","es-la":"Usami, una hermosa compa\u00f1era de clase, modelo de buena conducta y la mejor en calificaciones, me ve como su rival en la escuela. Sin embargo, despu\u00e9s de clases, ella muestra una faceta completamente diferente. Despu\u00e9s de la escuela, juega en la sala de juegos y muestra una inocente sonrisa que no podr\u00edas imaginar viendo en la escuela. Para acercarme a Usami, la acompa\u00f1\u00f3 en la escuela y jugamos juntos despu\u00e9s de clases. En cada lugar, nuestra amistad se profundiza, \u00a1y finalmente se abre el tel\u00f3n de una conmovedora comedia rom\u00e1ntica de tri\u00e1ngulo amoroso!","pt-br":"Usami \u00e9 uma linda colega de classe, com bons costumes e notas altas. Na escola, ela v\u00ea Sakuto como seu rival. Mas quando ele a encontra depois da escola, ele v\u00ea um lado diferente dela. Ela estava jogando no fliperama depois das aulas e tinha aquele sorriso inocente que ningu\u00e9m poderia imaginar nela na escola.\n\nPara se dar bem com ela, ele se aproxima dela na escola e depois joga com ela depois da escola. Cada um deles tem seus lugares onde podem aprofundar seus la\u00e7os e, finalmente...\n\nEste \u00e9 o in\u00edcio de uma com\u00e9dia rom\u00e2ntica de tri\u00e2ngulo amoroso comovente!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"177186","ap":"futago-matomete-kanojo-ni-shinai","bl":"20098019","bw":"series\/484041\/list","kt":"74960","mu":"wtr991i","nu":"why-not-make-both-twins-girlfriends","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/dp\/B0CW18C7P2","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/847708","mal":"169628","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_005433_S"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":"shounen","status":"ongoing","year":2024,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"aafb99c1-7f60-43fa-b75f-fc9502ce29c7","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"b9af3a63-f058-46de-a9a0-e0c13906197a","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Drama"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2024-04-25T18:55:09+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-10-27T09:36:53+00:00","version":50,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","vi","pt-br","es-la","id"],"latestUploadedChapter":"091f1056-bf76-4fab-89fd-7ae987f2a9ed"},"relationships":[{"id":"5ddb2651-41f8-40a2-bda6-c92b4de11e4b","type":"author"},{"id":"37ecc339-e3b5-4eec-949c-2c8ffdd8e056","type":"artist"},{"id":"55ec77ef-2c00-451e-a1d8-eee0f95ce84f","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"5","fileName":"37f8cee1-316c-4874-a1a4-bfaf16be23fd.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-09-19T11:39:13+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T11:39:13+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"c88ca39b-c68a-4551-ac6f-65d23cfcca72","type":"manga","related":"shared_universe"},{"id":"c3a21d7c-5c46-4367-9895-b8b04d6912e6","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"5d87d9cf-73ae-469b-80ed-0aaaffc42b03","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Zashiki no Nonono"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u3056\u3057\u304d\u306e\u306e\u306e\u306e"}],"description":{"en":"Top national exam scorer Horikoshi Tsuyuko found a little girl tied up in the sealed closet in her house, and this girl, Nonono, is a Zashiki warashi? Zashiki warashi are spirits that brings wealth and happiness to the household, and Nonono is here to bring prosperity to the Horikoshi family too... by blessing Tsuyuko with many offspring? Let's work hard and make babies!","es-la":"Horikoshi Tsuyuko, una estudiante con altas calificaciones en los ex\u00e1menes nacionales, encontr\u00f3 una ni\u00f1a atada en un viejo armario sellado, y esta peque\u00f1a, Nonono, \u00bfEs un Zashiki Warashi? Los Zashiki Warashi son esp\u00edritus que brindan salud y felicidad a las familias, y Nonono lleg\u00f3 para brindar prosperidada a la famiia Horikoshi tambi\u00e9n... \u00bfBendiciendo a Tsukuyo con muchos hijos? \u00a1Vamos a esforzarnos y hagamos hijos!"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"ap":"zashiki-no-nonono","mu":"0sc0807","cdj":"https:\/\/www.cdjapan.co.jp\/product\/NEOBK-1366520","ebj":"https:\/\/ebookjapan.yahoo.co.jp\/books\/788243\/A004460007\/"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"2","lastChapter":"24","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"completed","year":2011,"contentRating":"suggestive","tags":[{"id":"423e2eae-a7a2-4a8b-ac03-a8351462d71d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Romance"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"caaa44eb-cd40-4177-b930-79d3ef2afe87","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"School Life"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"e5301a23-ebd9-49dd-a0cb-2add944c7fe9","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Slice of Life"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"eabc5b4c-6aff-42f3-b657-3e90cbd00b75","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Supernatural"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-04-19T15:27:38+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T22:18:06+00:00","version":8,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["en","es-la"],"latestUploadedChapter":"e41b9fc5-f539-46b5-adf2-e15dcc361560"},"relationships":[{"id":"fb6df4b8-4626-40b4-9695-01c281aae5f0","type":"author"},{"id":"fb6df4b8-4626-40b4-9695-01c281aae5f0","type":"artist"},{"id":"037907b8-47c1-45a9-807b-20b28f2a3931","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"2","fileName":"c84a743f-321c-4dfd-9f38-1d4b16678450.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-06-09T05:20:18+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-06-09T05:20:18+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"ec91b2dc-137a-42ef-9324-9da38f933a35","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"c2068513-1e3b-4e44-b8f5-b0ac5567aa2b","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Tsuihou-kei no Akuyaku Party no Leader ni Tensei Shita node, Zamaa Sareru Mae ni Jibun o Tsuihou Shimashita.: Skill o Ubau \"Steal\" tte Akuyakusugiru kedo Tsuyosugiru"},"altTitles":[{"ja":"\u8ffd\u653e\u7cfb\u306e\u60aa\u5f79\u30d1\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u306e\u30ea\u30fc\u30c0\u30fc\u306b\u8ee2\u751f\u3057\u305f\u306e\u3067\u3001\u3056\u307e\u3041\u3055\u308c\u308b\u524d\u306b\u81ea\u5206\u3092\u8ffd\u653e\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\u3000\uff5e\u30b9\u30ad\u30eb\u3092\u596a\u3046\u300e\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30fc\u30eb\u300f\u3063\u3066\u60aa\u5f79\u904e\u304e\u308b\u3051\u3069\u5f37\u3059\u304e\u308b\uff5e"},{"en":"I Reincarnated as the Leader of a Villain Party, so I Kicked Myself Out Before the Revenge Plot Could Begin"},{"ja-ro":"Tsuihou-kei no Akuyaku Party no Leader ni Tensei Shita node, Zamaa Sareru Mae ni Jibun wo Tsuihou Shimashita.: Skill wo Ubau \"Steal\" tte Akuyakusugiru kedo Tsuyosugiru"},{"vi":"Chuy\u1ec3n Sinh Th\u00e0nh Tr\u01b0\u1edfng Nh\u00f3m Ph\u1ea3n Di\u1ec7n Chuy\u00ean \u0110i \u0110u\u1ed5i Ng\u01b0\u1eddi, T\u00f4i T\u1ef1 \u0110u\u1ed5i Ch\u00ednh M\u00ecnh Tr\u01b0\u1edbc Khi B\u1ecb Tr\u1ea3 Th\u00f9! ~K\u1ef9 N\u0103ng C\u01b0\u1edbp \u0110o\u1ea1t \"Steal\" Tuy Qu\u00e1 Ph\u1ea3n Di\u1ec7n Nh\u01b0ng L\u1ea1i Qu\u00e1 B\u00e1 \u0110\u1ea1o~"}],"description":{"en":"I had been reincarnated as the leader of a villain party in an exile-type anime. Just as I was about to exile the story's protagonist, in order to avoid the death route where I'd get my comeuppance just like in the anime, I decided to exile myself instead!?","vi":"T\u00f4i chuy\u1ec3n sinh th\u00e0nh tr\u01b0\u1edfng nh\u00f3m ph\u1ea3n di\u1ec7n trong m\u1ed9t b\u1ed9 anime th\u1ec3 lo\u1ea1i 'tr\u1ee5c xu\u1ea5t'. Ngay th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111u\u1ed5i nh\u00e2n v\u1eadt ch\u00ednh \u0111i, \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh con \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng ch\u1ebft v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb tr\u1ea3 th\u00f9 \u0111\u00edch \u0111\u00e1ng nh\u01b0 trong anime, t\u00f4i quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh t\u1ef1 \u0111u\u1ed5i ch\u00ednh m\u00ecnh lu\u00f4n!?"},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"219656","bl":"20198296","bw":"series\/622742\/list","mu":"ny5kclx","nu":"i-was-reincarnated-as-the-leader-of-a-banishment-type-villain-party-so-i-banished-myself-before-i-got-what-i-deserved-the-steal-skill-stealing-ability-is-too-villainous-but-its","amz":"https:\/\/www.amazon.co.jp\/-\/en\/dp\/4047383007","mal":"194820","raw":"https:\/\/comic-walker.com\/detail\/KC_008650_S"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"","lastChapter":"","publicationDemographic":null,"status":"ongoing","year":2026,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"0bc90acb-ccc1-44ca-a34a-b9f3a73259d0","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Reincarnation"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"36fd93ea-e8b8-445e-b836-358f02b3d33d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monsters"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"391b0423-d847-456f-aff0-8b0cfc03066b","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Action"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"4d32cc48-9f00-4cca-9b5a-a839f0764984","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Comedy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"5fff9cde-849c-4d78-aab0-0d52b2ee1d25","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Survival"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"87cc87cd-a395-47af-b27a-93258283bbc6","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adventure"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"a1f53773-c69a-4ce5-8cab-fffcd90b1565","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Magic"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"aafb99c1-7f60-43fa-b75f-fc9502ce29c7","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Harem"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"ace04997-f6bd-436e-b261-779182193d3d","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Isekai"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"cdc58593-87dd-415e-bbc0-2ec27bf404cc","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Fantasy"},"description":{},"group":"genre","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"dd1f77c5-dea9-4e2b-97ae-224af09caf99","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Monster Girls"},"description":{},"group":"theme","version":1},"relationships":[]},{"id":"f4122d1c-3b44-44d0-9936-ff7502c39ad3","type":"tag","attributes":{"name":{"en":"Adaptation"},"description":{},"group":"format","version":1},"relationships":[]}],"state":"published","chapterNumbersResetOnNewVolume":false,"createdAt":"2026-07-11T15:21:34+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-11-09T20:00:28+00:00","version":24,"availableTranslatedLanguages":["vi","en","id"],"latestUploadedChapter":"85cad496-13d6-4ded-9205-56b5460fcaef"},"relationships":[{"id":"da58e063-04e5-4903-831b-98a8553ec3f4","type":"author"},{"id":"114d4c73-75fb-4c85-8eca-da202b0cd623","type":"artist"},{"id":"1481ba14-f7d5-4d09-b608-c88f1c65d5fc","type":"cover_art","attributes":{"description":"","volume":"1","fileName":"fc5e65c2-574d-4bad-b8b0-2f478ffe811f.jpg","locale":"ja","createdAt":"2026-09-19T08:06:46+00:00","updatedAt":"2026-09-19T08:06:46+00:00","version":1}},{"id":"7e959216-c9b7-482e-8000-d3ee0c0d7d74","type":"creator"}]},{"id":"c40bf165-81fa-499f-b368-48b353a968df","type":"manga","attributes":{"title":{"ja-ro":"Another"},"altTitles":[{"ko":"Another (\uc5b4\ub098\ub354)"},{"ru":"\u0418\u043d\u0430\u044f"},{"ja":"\u30a2\u30ca\u30b6\u30fc"},{"uk":"\u0406\u043d\u0448\u0430"},{"en":"Another"}],"description":{"en":"In the spring of 1998, Koichi Sakakibara transfers into Class 3-3 at Yomiyama North Middle School. But little does he know, his new class has a horrible secret. \n\nWhen he takes his seat in class for the first day of school, Koichi is unsettled by his fearful classmates. Despite this atmosphere and warnings from fellow students, Koichi is drawn to the beautiful, distant Mei Misaki, another classmate. But the closer he tries to get to her, the more mysterious she and their class become. And when a fellow student dies a disturbing death - the first of a long chain of deaths - Koichi seeks to learn the truth behind the curse of Class 3-3. \n\nBut can he get answers before the curse kills him?","ru":"26 \u043b\u0435\u0442 \u043d\u0430\u0437\u0430\u0434 \u0432 \u0442\u0440\u0435\u0442\u044c\u0435\u043c \u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0435 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043d\u0435\u0439 \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044b \u0443\u0447\u0438\u043b\u0430\u0441\u044c \u0441\u0442\u0443\u0434\u0435\u043d\u0442\u043a\u0430 \u043f\u043e \u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u041c\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043a\u0438. \u0423\u0441\u043f\u0435\u0448\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0432 \u0443\u0447\u0451\u0431\u0435 \u0438 \u0441\u043f\u043e\u0440\u0442\u0435, \u043e\u043d\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430 \u043f\u043e\u043f\u0443\u043b\u044f\u0440\u043d\u0430 \u0441\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0438 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043d\u0438\u043a\u043e\u0432. \u041a\u043e\u0433\u0434\u0430 \u041c\u0438\u0441\u0430\u043a\u0438 \u0432\u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u043f\u043d\u043e \u0443\u043c\u0435\u0440\u043b\u0430, \u0435\u0451 \u043e\u0434\u043d\u043e\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u043d\u0438\u043a\u0438 \u0440\u0435\u0448\u0438\u043b\u0438 \u0432\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0435\u0431\u044f \u0442\u0430\u043a, \u043a\u0430\u043a \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0431\u044b \u043e\u043d\u0430 \u0431\u044b\u043b\u0430 \u0435\u0449\u0435 \u0436\u0438\u0432\u0430, \u0434\u043e \u0441\u0430\u043c\u043e\u0433\u043e \u043e\u043a\u043e\u043d\u0447\u0430\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0448\u043a\u043e\u043b\u044b. \u0412\u0435\u0441\u043d\u043e\u0439 1998 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0430 \u0432 \u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441, \u043d\u0430\u0445\u043e\u0434\u044f\u0449\u0438\u0439\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0442\u043e\u043c \u0441\u0430\u043c\u043e\u043c \u043a\u0430\u0431\u0438\u043d\u0435\u0442\u0435, \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u043f\u0430\u0440\u0435\u043d\u044c \u043f\u043e \u0438\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0438 \u041a\u043e\u0438\u0447\u0438 \u0421\u0430\u043a\u0430\u043a\u0438\u0431\u0430\u0440\u0430. \u0421\u043e \u0432\u0440\u0435\u043c\u0435\u043d\u0435\u043c \u043e\u043d \u043d\u0430\u0447\u0438\u043d\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u0447\u0443\u0432\u0441\u0442\u0432\u043e\u0432\u0430\u0442\u044c \u0441\u0442\u0440\u0430\u043d\u043d\u0443\u044e \u0430\u0442\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0444\u0435\u0440\u0443, \u0446\u0430\u0440\u044f\u0449\u0443\u044e \u0432 \u044d\u0442\u043e\u043c \u043a\u043b\u0430\u0441\u0441\u0435. \u0418 \u043d\u0430\u0438\u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u0439 \u0438\u043d\u0442\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0441 \u0443 \u043d\u0435\u0433\u043e \u0432\u044b\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u0435\u0442 \u043a\u0440\u0430\u0441\u0438\u0432\u0430\u044f \u0434\u0435\u0432\u0443\u0448\u043a\u0430, \u0447\u0442\u043e \u0434\u0435\u0440\u0436\u0438\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0432 \u0441\u0442\u043e\u0440\u043e\u043d\u0435 \u043e\u0442\u043e \u0432\u0441\u0435\u0445 \u0438 \u043f\u043e\u0441\u0442\u043e\u044f\u043d\u043d\u043e \u0440\u0438\u0441\u0443\u0435\u0442 \u0447\u0442\u043e-\u0442\u043e \u0432 \u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d\u043e\u0447\u0435\u0441\u0442\u0432\u0435\u2026  \r\n  \r\nLinks:  \r\n[AnimeNewsNetwork](https:\/\/www.animenewsnetwork.com\/encyclopedia\/anime.php?id=13258) (anime)  \r\n[AnimeNewsNetwork](https:\/\/www.animenewsnetwork.com\/encyclopedia\/anime.php?id=14287) (live-action movie)","pt-br":"26 anos atr\u00e1s, na terceira classe do terceiro ano de uma escola de ensino m\u00e9dio, existia uma estudante chamada Misaki. Uma estudante de honra que tamb\u00e9m era boa nos esportes e popular entre os colegas. Quando ela morreu de repente, seus colegas decidiram fingir que ela ainda estava viva at\u00e9 a formatura. Ent\u00e3o, na primavera de 1998, um garoto chamado Kouichi Sakakibara \u00e9 transferido para essa classe, e ele se torna desconfiado na atmosfera pesada na sala de aula. Em particular, h\u00e1 uma garota linda, chamada Misaki Mei que usa um tapa olho e est\u00e1 sempre sozinha desenhando."},"isLocked":false,"links":{"al":"54098","ap":"another","bl":"172885","bw":"series\/1667\/list","kt":"16161","mu":"1auj477","mal":"24098","engtl":"https:\/\/yenpress.com\/series\/another-manga"},"officialLinks":null,"originalLanguage":"ja","lastVolume":"4","lastChapter":"20","publicationDemographic":"seinen","status":"completed","year":2010,"contentRating":"safe","tags":[{"id":"3b60b75c